>First, what goes in the x2 of nanla/nixli/verba, the age of the
>boy/girl/child?
>Is it the number of years? As in:
>
>            ta verba li se
>            That is a child of 7.

I would say
            ta verba lo nanca be li se
or
            ta verba lo nanca zemei
(make that ze in your sentence and my first response)

